OL,3,AFour Renoir paintings worth millions
OL,4,Astolen in French museum heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe paintings, each worth bB,9m (#7.7m;
OL,7,F$10.4m), are the latest high-profile
OL,8,Fpieces to have been stolen this year
OL,9,Ffollowing a string of heists in Europe
OL,10,F- which have included four Renaissance
OL,11,Fpaintings being stolen from a museum in
OL,12,FSicily just last month.
